="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Optional to own, but all amenities belong to the club, so non-members get none</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Luxury custom homes</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">POA about $115 a quarter; club dues separate</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Gatehouse at the entrance</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top"><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Wachesaw East</strong></td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Murrells Inlet</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Clyde Johnston course, former LPGA tour host, public</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">None required</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Mid-market houses and townhomes</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Covers pool, tennis, fitness</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Gate at the entrance</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top"><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Pawleys Plantation</strong></td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Pawleys Island</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Jack Nicklaus Signature, renovated and reopened October 2023</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top">Optional; golf and social tiers through Founders Group</td><td style="padding:.5rem .7rem;border-bott